  "notes": [
    "Remove the `s` share-attribution query key from exact `x.com` status-video links using a narrowly bounded host and path rule.",
    "Preserve functional and unknown query parameters, their source order and untouched raw encoding, bare tokens, literal plus signs, and fragments.",
    "Reject adjacent paths, similarly named parameters, alternate and lookalike hosts, credential tricks, and non-HTTPS links. Public examples use synthetic account and status identifiers.",
    "Supersede Beta `2026.10.08.5`; leave Stable `2026.09.21.1` unchanged."
  ]
}
